<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian military drones have entered Sudan while RSF drones are being launched from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consulate closures by both states. In northern Ethiopia, WHO warns the health system is near collapse as attacks on civilians continue, including an RPG strike near a school in Moyale that killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers and forced Kenya to register over 50,000 Ethiopian refugees. Kenyan police IG Douglas Kanja has deployed more officers to Moyale and led security talks after a Kenyan was killed in the clashes. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOZDJ2MGo2Tl80VHRKREh2d3dOTXZxR2xHc2RPenJVWDY1RUF0X2tnNHRuLTZ4bTd2QXJndi1ubDJmcXZLbUlyZzlEcDJ0SWt5MEd0V18zdWFPS0g5N2lsTU9oTGNzRG5DUHFZX0QxVy1nWWw3b2d6OC1SbzFNbUNqcDY5RjdQYW1uVjdLZHU1b1pJRy1vdS1UdnhoS1lGUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5CVGVJZm1aalQwN2hISm5maXhReGZydjRYdHp3VHB6dklkX3poaDA3aDBEcU5XODZWcXhzVjhvSTg2b2JrbFlkSDM1LTUtd0NFR2dGV2NyYUY?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9rWUhrcTV0Rkc0TGlsUGN6NGpwZmsxYXF1aXNIQUJGM09QRjZKeWdnZVJfd2F0X21GWEZTVEZrc0NPR09MS2RaQ1JMcVR2NDdpcWIzeUJ6SHdMMThtekE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPNjNsY1YyTGJZazBiWnAzM1JackgxcVU4cnc4TnpYTFh1c2h5OS1GUERVbldXRkhUaFZOLTVMUlNTbFJDQWJ1ZVhTdmk0SUk0SVYxSlo0WXEyWWUzXzVablg1Yml4RV9hNWNQdlV4X2xlUmN